---
description: Review a Vibestudio conversation delivery, exact-context surface, or canonical agentic protocol change.
args:
  request: ConversationRequest
returns: ConversationReport
---
Call reviewDelivery, reviewSurface, or reviewContract according to request.kind. Return its assessment. Every fact refers to the assigned receipt, channel or revision. Do not send another message, change capabilities, use a different runtime subject, or repair the retained records while reviewing them.
